If you are neutral, I'd opt for wishing for the Eyes of the Overworld.
Confers magic resistance while carried and grants Astral Vision when
worn, so you can still keep the light source (and gain a superior one
imo) and get the MR and enlightenment is nice as well.  Aside from
that all of my other suggestions would be well documented in a wishing
spoiler that you can find easily.  If you aren't neutral, I still
think you should use that wish, as it will be more vital to your
survival to gain magic resistance over a permanent light source (which
is merely a hindrance that you can overcome fairly easily).  Best of
luck to you.

